<section class="hub-sec"><h2 class="section-title">11 stories</h2><ul class="archive"><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/wtt-calendar-player-workload-injuries"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--Features, var(--ink))">Analysis</span><h2>How much do the top players play? Eleven counted every WTT match since June</h2><p>Five of the 20 players in the two world top 10s are missing from WTT Champions Frankfurt. Eleven counted every WTT match the top 20 have played since June, and the busiest players on the tour are mostly not the ones who have been injured.</p><time datetime="2026-11-05T08:00:00Z">By Eleven Team, 5 November 2026, 08:00</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026">WTT Champions Montpellier 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-frankfurt-2026">WTT Champions Frankfurt 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/alexis-lebrun">Alexis Lebrun</a></li></ul></li><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/fake-table-tennis-live-streams-china-sun-yingsha-wang-yidi-montpellier"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--International, var(--ink))">International</span><h2>Fake live streams of Sun Yingsha&#x27;s WTT Champions Montpellier semi-final used to sell goods in China</h2><p>Hosts spliced old match audio with invented scores five hours before the real match began, then sold pain-relief patches and eye drops at the tense moments.</p><time datetime="2026-11-04T12:30:00Z">By Eleven Team, 4 November 2026, 12:30</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026">WTT Champions Montpellier 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-country" href="/tag/china">China</a></li></ul></li><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/wtt-champions-frankfurt-2026-day-one-preview-order-of-play"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--International, var(--ink))">Day 1 preview</span><h2>WTT Champions Frankfurt day one preview: Wang Chuqin returns as Miwa Harimoto and Matsushima start</h2><p>The world&#x27;s top three men all play on Tuesday, and Miwa Harimoto, now the women&#x27;s favourite, opens the tournament against Sofia Polcanova at 11am UK time.</p><time datetime="2026-11-03T00:40:00Z">By Eleven Team, 3 November 2026, 00:40</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-frankfurt-2026">WTT Champions Frankfurt 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/wang-chuqin">Wang Chuqin</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/sofia-polcanova">Sofia Polcanova</a></li></ul></li><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/sun-yingsha-withdraws-wtt-champions-frankfurt-2026-montpellier"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--International, var(--ink))">International</span><h2>Sun Yingsha pulls out of WTT Champions Frankfurt a day after winning in Montpellier</h2><p>Poland&#x27;s Natalia Bajor replaces the world No 2, leaving Miwa Harimoto as the highest-ranked woman in the draw after Wang Manyu also withdrew.</p><time datetime="2026-11-02T04:25:00Z">By Eleven Team, 2 November 2026, 04:25</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-frankfurt-2026">WTT Champions Frankfurt 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026">WTT Champions Montpellier 2026</a></li></ul></li><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026-day-six-review-results-highlights"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--International, var(--ink))">Day 6 review</span><h2>WTT Champions Montpellier finals: Sun Yingsha beats Kuai Man as Jang Woojin comes from 3-1 down</h2><p>Sun dropped the opening game before winning the next four, while Franziska was one game from the title before Jang won the last three.</p><time datetime="2026-11-01T19:20:00Z">By Eleven Team, 1 November 2026, 19:20</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026">WTT Champions Montpellier 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-frankfurt-2026">WTT Champions Frankfurt 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/jang-woojin">Jang Woojin</a></li></ul></li><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026-day-six-preview-order-of-play"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--International, var(--ink))">Day 6 preview</span><h2>WTT Champions Montpellier finals day preview: Sun Yingsha meets Wang Yidi, Moregard plays Franziska</h2><p>China are certain of the women&#x27;s title, and Moregard is the last of the top four men&#x27;s seeds left, with both finals in the late afternoon.</p><time datetime="2026-11-01T07:50:00Z">By Eleven Team, 1 November 2026, 07:50</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026">WTT Champions Montpellier 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/truls-moregard">Truls Moregard</a></li></ul></li><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026-day-five-review-results-highlights"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--International, var(--ink))">Day 5 review</span><h2>WTT Champions Montpellier day five review: Kuai Man ends Miwa Harimoto&#x27;s run as Moregard survives</h2><p>Four of the eight quarter-finals went the full seven games, and all four women&#x27;s semi-finalists are Chinese.</p><time datetime="2026-10-31T21:50:00Z">By Eleven Team, 31 October 2026, 21:50</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026">WTT Champions Montpellier 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/miwa-harimoto">Miwa Harimoto</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/truls-moregard">Truls Moregard</a></li></ul></li><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026-day-four-review-results-highlights"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--International, var(--ink))">Day 4 review</span><h2>WTT Champions Montpellier day four review: Chen Yi beats Wang Manyu as Zhou knocks out Félix Lebrun</h2><p>Neither top seed is left after the last 16, and France have no one in the quarter-finals after Gauzy also lost from two games up.</p><time datetime="2026-10-30T21:40:00Z">By Eleven Team, 30 October 2026, 21:40</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026">WTT Champions Montpellier 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/felix-lebrun">Félix Lebrun</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/wang-manyu">Wang Manyu</a></li></ul></li><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026-day-four-preview-order-of-play"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--International, var(--ink))">Day 4 preview</span><h2>WTT Champions Montpellier day four preview: Wang Manyu meets Chen Yi as Félix Lebrun plays Zhou Qihao</h2><p>Eleven last-16 matches decide the rest of the quarter-final line-up, with the top seed Wang Manyu facing the new Asian champion in the first match of the day.</p><time datetime="2026-10-30T08:40:00Z">By Eleven Team, 30 October 2026, 08:40</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026">WTT Champions Montpellier 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/felix-lebrun">Félix Lebrun</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/wang-manyu">Wang Manyu</a></li></ul></li><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026-day-one-review-results-highlights"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--International, var(--ink))">Day 1 review</span><h2>WTT Champions Montpellier day one review: Sun Yingsha returns as Matsushima survives a scare</h2><p>Sun Yingsha dropped 14 points in her first match for about three weeks, Félix Lebrun won in 15 minutes and the world No 1 let slip a two-game lead before recovering.</p><time datetime="2026-10-28T09:05:00Z">By Eleven Team, 28 October 2026, 09:05</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026">WTT Champions Montpellier 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/felix-lebrun">Félix Lebrun</a></li></ul></li><li class="archive-item"><a href="/news/montpellier-draw-lebrun-sun-yingsha-2026"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--International, var(--ink))">International</span><h2>WTT Champions Montpellier 2026 preview: Wang Chuqin out as Lebrun brothers and Sun Yingsha learn their openers</h2><p>Félix Lebrun opens against Anders Lind, Sun Yingsha returns against Camille Lutz, and Lin Shidong leads China&#x27;s men after the world champion&#x27;s withdrawal.</p><time datetime="2026-10-26T20:25:00Z">By Eleven Team, 26 October 2026, 20:25</time></a><ul class="tags" aria-label="Tags"><li><a class="tg tg-tournament" href="/tag/wtt-champions-montpellier-2026">WTT Champions Montpellier 2026</a></li><li><a class="tg tg-player" href="/tag/felix-lebrun">Félix Lebrun</a></li></ul></li></ul></section>
